<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36786" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαν-έχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold up from</i>: mostly intr., <i>jut out from, stand up
				upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκὼν ἐ. γαίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.370
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήλη ἐ. τύμβου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					22.207
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			 (impf. and aor. 2 with double augm.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηνειχόμην, ἐξηνεσχόμην,</span>
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέχω</span>), <i>bear up against,
				endure, suffer,</i> with part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὗ λόγων ἄλγιστ᾽ ἂν ἐξανασχοίμην
					κλύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1174
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1355
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				952
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰρ ἐξηνέσχετο ἰδών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					702
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα παῖδας ἐξανέξεται πάσχοντας;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					74
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Andr.</u>
				201
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα δόξανθ᾽ . .
			ἐξηνέσχετο</span> that these things should be decreed, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				967
			</span></i>.</div>
